---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import { SITE_SETTINGS } from '../lib/store';

const breadcrumbItems = [
  { name: 'Home', url: '/' },
  { name: 'Privacy Policy', url: '/privacy-policy' }
];
---

<Layout 
  title="Privacy Policy & CCPA Rights"
  description="Privacy Policy for Edgar Valle | Realtor (Full Circle Group). California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA/CPRA) disclosures, data retention, and consumer rights."
  canonicalUrl="/privacy-policy"
  breadcrumbs={breadcrumbItems}
>
  <Breadcrumbs items={breadcrumbItems} />
  <div class="section">
    <div class="container container-narrow">
      <div class="section-header" style="text-align: left; margin-bottom: 2.5rem;">
        <span class="section-eyebrow">YOUR PRIVACY &amp; CALIFORNIA CONSUMER RIGHTS</span>
        <h1>Privacy Policy &amp; CCPA Notice</h1>
        <p class="lead">Last Updated: October 2026. This comprehensive Privacy Policy outlines how Edgar Valle ({SITE_SETTINGS.brokerage_name}, California DRE #{SITE_SETTINGS.dre_license}) collects, safeguards, retains, and handles your personal information under California and federal privacy regulations.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card" style="padding: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: 2rem;">
        <h3>1. Introduction &amp; Scope</h3>
        <p>
          Edgar Valle is committed to upholding the highest standards of digital privacy, professional ethics, and transparency. This policy applies to personal data collected through <a href="https://edgarvalle.com" style="color: var(--color-gold-700);">edgarvalle.com</a>, property inquiry forms, consultation requests, and direct client advisory communications.
        </p>

        <h3 style="margin-top: 1.75rem;">2. Categories of Personal Information Collected</h3>
        <p>In the preceding 12 months, we have collected the following categories of personal information for verified real estate business purposes:</p>
        
        <div style="overflow-x: auto; margin: 1.25rem 0;">
          <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 0.88rem; text-align: left;">
            <thead>
              <tr style="background: var(--bg-surface); border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border-light);">
                <th style="padding: 0.75rem 1rem;">CCPA Category</th>
                <th style="padding: 0.75rem 1rem;">Examples Collected</th>
                <th style="padding: 0.75rem 1rem;">Business Purpose</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-light);">
                <td style="padding: 0.75rem 1rem;"><strong>A. Identifiers</strong></td>
                <td style="padding: 0.75rem 1rem;">Full name, email address, telephone number, IP address, device user agent.</td>
                <td style="padding: 0.75rem 1rem;">Responding to property inquiries, coordinating showings, fraud prevention.</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-light);">
                <td style="padding: 0.75rem 1rem;"><strong>B. California Customer Records</strong></td>
                <td style="padding: 0.75rem 1rem;">Property search criteria, budget ranges, timeframe, mortgage pre-approval status.</td>
                <td style="padding: 0.75rem 1rem;">Tailoring MLS property recommendations, preparing comparative market analyses (CMAs).</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-light);">
                <td style="padding: 0.75rem 1rem;"><strong>F. Internet Activity</strong></td>
                <td style="padding: 0.75rem 1rem;">Pages visited, listing views, referrer source, anonymous session identifiers.</td>
                <td style="padding: 0.75rem 1rem;">Aggregate performance monitoring and site optimization. No cross-site profiling.</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>

        <h3 style="margin-top: 1.75rem;">3. Data Minimization &amp; No Sale of Data</h3>
        <p>
          We strictly practice data minimization: we only request information reasonably necessary to assist your San Diego home purchase, sale, or investment.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>We never sell, rent, or trade your personal information to third-party data brokers, marketers, or lead aggregators.</strong>
        </p>

        <h3 style="margin-top: 1.75rem;">4. Authorized Service Providers &amp; Disclosures</h3>
        <p>Your data is shared strictly with authorized infrastructure processors and verified settlement partners:</p>
        <ul style="margin: 0 0 1.25rem 1.5rem; color: var(--text-secondary);">
          <li><strong>Database &amp; Storage:</strong> Supabase PostgreSQL (encrypted in transit via TLS 1.3 and at rest with AES-256).</li>
          <li><strong>Escrow, Title &amp; Lenders:</strong> Only after you execute an active representation agreement and specifically instruct us to open an escrow file or connect with a mortgage loan originator.</li>
          <li><strong>Legal &amp; Regulatory Authorities:</strong> As required by California DRE audits, subpoenas, or statutory reporting mandates.</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 style="margin-top: 1.75rem;">5. Data Retention &amp; Deletion Schedules</h3>
        <p>We retain personal information only for as long as necessary to fulfill the purposes for which it was collected or to satisfy statutory obligations:</p>
        <ul style="margin: 0 0 1.25rem 1.5rem; color: var(--text-secondary);">
          <li><strong>Real Estate Transaction Records:</strong> Retained for a mandatory minimum of <strong>3 years</strong> pursuant to California Business and Professions Code § 10148 (DRE recordkeeping requirement).</li>
          <li><strong>General Inquiries &amp; Consultations:</strong> Retained for <strong>24 months</strong> from last customer contact, after which records are securely purged.</li>
          <li><strong>Analytics Telemetry:</strong> Aggregated daily rollups retained for <strong>24 months</strong>; all raw session tokens are automatically expired upon browser session termination.</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 style="margin-top: 1.75rem;">6. California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA / CPRA) Rights</h3>
        <p>If you are a California resident, you possess the following statutory rights:</p>
        <ul style="margin: 0 0 1.25rem 1.5rem; color: var(--text-secondary);">
          <li><strong>Right to Know:</strong> You may request disclosure of the categories and specific pieces of personal information collected about you.</li>
          <li><strong>Right to Delete:</strong> You may request deletion of personal information, subject to statutory exemptions (including California DRE 3-year transaction record retention requirements).</li>
          <li><strong>Right to Correct:</strong> You may request correction of inaccurate personal information.</li>
          <li><strong>Right to Non-Discrimination:</strong> We will never deny services, charge different rates, or provide a lower quality of service for exercising your privacy rights.</li>
        </ul>

        <div style="background: var(--bg-surface); border: 1px solid var(--border-light); padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 8px; margin: 1.5rem 0;">
          <h4 style="margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0; color: #ffffff;">Submit a California Privacy Rights Request</h4>
          <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; margin: 0 0 1rem 0;">To submit a verified request to know, delete, or correct your personal data, contact Edgar Valle:</p>
          <ul style="margin: 0 0 0 1.25rem; font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-secondary);">
            <li>Email: <a href={`mailto:${SITE_SETTINGS.email}?subject=CCPA%20Privacy%20Request`} style="color: var(--color-gold-700);">{SITE_SETTINGS.email}</a></li>
            <li>Direct Phone: <a href={`tel:${SITE_SETTINGS.phone.replace(/\\D/g, '')}`} style="color: var(--color-gold-700);">{SITE_SETTINGS.phone}</a></li>
            <li>Mail: Edgar Valle | Realtor, Full Circle Group, San Diego, CA</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <h3 style="margin-top: 1.75rem;">7. Marketing Communications &amp; Opt-Out</h3>
        <p>
          We do not send unsolicited commercial email or automated SMS marketing. You will only receive real estate updates or property listings if you have affirmatively requested them. To unsubscribe at any time, reply "STOP" to text messages or email <a href={`mailto:${SITE_SETTINGS.email}?subject=Unsubscribe`} style="color: var(--color-gold-700);">{SITE_SETTINGS.email}</a> with the subject line "Unsubscribe".
        </p>

        <h3 style="margin-top: 1.75rem;">8. Contact Information &amp; DRE Verification</h3>
        <p>
          <strong>Edgar Valle | Realtor</strong><br />
          Brokerage: {SITE_SETTINGS.brokerage_name}<br />
          California DRE License: #{SITE_SETTINGS.dre_license}<br />
          Direct: {SITE_SETTINGS.phone}<br />
          Email: {SITE_SETTINGS.email}<br />
          Location: San Diego, California
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
